Package: DIVE
Type: Package
Title: Diversity-Informed Valuation of Ecosystem Functioning
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "A.",
        family = "Mahajna",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "Asala.Mahajna@wetsus.nl "
    )
Description:
    Provides tools for relating microbial community alpha-diversity
    characteristics to ecosystem functionality through temporal
    association analysis. DIVE supports regularly sampled observations
    using lagged cross-correlation and irregularly sampled observations
    using exact-lag discrete correlation analysis. The package is
    designed for high-dimensional microbial community data represented
    as TreeSummarizedExperiment objects.
